{"unit_id":"x402__dsh-fail-fast#card-zh","repo":"x402/dsh-fail-fast","commit":"a0a9134b0610152e8524faac14e6ef4cc9bd81c9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fail-fast（DSH 插件，适用于 DSH 客户端）：在同一 step 的工具调用中，遇到失败后阻止尚未启动的后续调用。它监听 session/event 记录调用顺序，观察 tools/result 确定失败位置，并在 tools/pre-execute 阶段拒绝后续调用。主要功能包括批次跟踪、识别失败结果、返回“未执行”错误，以及在新 step 重置状态。已启动的同组调用继续完成，嵌套 PTC 调用不受影响。适合希望工具步骤失败后先让模型修正再继续的 DSH 使用者，无需额外密钥或运行时配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:107-169","cordis.patch.yml:8-10"]}
{"unit_id":"x402__dsh-fail-fast#card-en","repo":"x402/dsh-fail-fast","commit":"a0a9134b0610152e8524faac14e6ef4cc9bd81c9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-fail-fast tracks tool calls in each DSH step and skips unstarted calls after a failure. It observes session events and results, then denies later calls with a not-executed error. State resets each step; started and nested PTC calls are unaffected. No API key or configuration is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:107-169","cordis.patch.yml:8-10"]}
