{"unit_id":"x402__dsh-fail-fast#feature-1","repo":"x402/dsh-fail-fast","commit":"a0a9134b0610152e8524faac14e6ef4cc9bd81c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fail-fast 的功能「失败后跳过后续调用」：记录当前 step 的模型调用顺序。某次工具结果失败后，失败点之后仍未启动的调用会在执行前被拒绝，并得到说明其未执行的错误结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:91-101","src/index.js:111-169"]}
{"unit_id":"x402__dsh-fail-fast#feature-2","repo":"x402/dsh-fail-fast","commit":"a0a9134b0610152e8524faac14e6ef4cc9bd81c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fail-fast 的功能「保留已启动调用并隔离新步骤」：已启动的调用不被撤回；新 step 开始时建立新批次，先前步骤的失败状态不会继续影响后续步骤。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:91-101","src/index.js:111-169"]}
{"unit_id":"x402__dsh-fail-fast#feature-3","repo":"x402/dsh-fail-fast","commit":"a0a9134b0610152e8524faac14e6ef4cc9bd81c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fail-fast 的功能「排除嵌套和无会话执行」：仅处理关联到活动 agent session 的模型直接调用；带有 parent 的嵌套调用和没有 session 的调用会绕过批次拦截。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:91-101","src/index.js:111-169"]}
{"unit_id":"x402__dsh-fail-fast#caveat-1","repo":"x402/dsh-fail-fast","commit":"a0a9134b0610152e8524faac14e6ef4cc9bd81c9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fail-fast 使用前须知：失败发生时已经启动的同组调用会继续完成，插件只阻止尚未启动的调用；工具若要更早停止，需要自行响应 exec.signal。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:12-21","README.md:48-53"]}
